.TH "nvme_init_get_log_lost_host_comm" 9 "nvme_init_get_log_lost_host_comm" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_get_log_lost_host_comm \- Initialize passthru command for Lost Host Communication
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_get_log_lost_host_comm
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool rae "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_lost_host_comm_log *log "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "rae" 12
Retain Asynchronous Event
.IP "log" 12
User address to store the log page
.IP "len" 12
The allocated length of the log page
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Get Log command with
LID value NVME_LOG_LID_LOST_HOST_COMMUNICATION
